#VRML V2.0 utf8
# Project-authored standards fixture (oracle/standards/README.md).
# Clause numbers are those of the Web3D free copy of ISO/IEC 14772-1:1997; equality with the ISO text UNVERIFIED.
# 4.5.2 URLs: the url strings are locations in decreasing order of preference. When the browser
# cannot locate the data of one, it shall try the next. The first entry is a local file that does
# not exist, the second a host in the reserved .invalid domain (RFC 2606), the third basic-child.wrl.
DEF Fallback Inline {
  url [ "absent-fallback-child.wrl"
        "http://inline-url-fallback.invalid/child.wrl"
        "basic-child.wrl" ]
}
